{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act16side_level_act16side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act16side",
  "stageId": "act16side_03",
  "title": "Mixed Blood",
  "storyCode": "GA-3",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "40536318d67d366d73bc95a29de446fcc74ec79771f7b0eedd9a9cefd1d527a8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, Fiammetta... Hm? Seems like you're in a bit of a mess."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "None of your business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No need to get worked up. Care to sit down for a cup of tea?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Enough of your jokes. Why are you here? Mostima never mentioned you were our support."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, Velliv didn't give me an official order either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And personally, I'm more than willing to help, yeah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mostima says there's another group after the little girl, and you've already run into them. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "More or less."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "After I heard from the Notarial Hall that Ezell cut his signal, I figured you might get intercepted. If you were to get caught out by the enemy, we'd end up losing the girl, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't know why Mostima isn't here to help you, but if she's pinned down, I figure I'll be doing her a favor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "After all, it's not every day I get the opportunity to have the two of you in my debt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A few hopeless stragglers can't stop me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'A cautious crew sails for ten thousand years,' Fiammetta. Velliv's going to have a hold over you at this rate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, that's a Yanese proverb. In other words, safety is born of caution."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stop trying to show off, Oren. You're so annoying when you talk like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not kidding. I at least got to express my goodwill. The rest is up to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Or, do you perhaps need me to escort you, my sweet Fiammetta?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No need. Goodbye, Oren."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Executor Ezell, hand over the girl."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It is in your best interest to comply."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your name is Fiammetta, right? Seniora Fiammetta, I have a request."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's hear it then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No sudden movements. There's no telling how I might react."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know it was suspicious of me to go against Richele's orders and turn off my terminal, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Believe me, I haven't betrayed Laterano."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The reason I didn't follow the Hall's exact orders was because I didn't want anything to happen to Cecelia... And, I made a promise to her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And how is that my problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please just let me accompany you to the Basilica with Cecelia. If the Lateran Curia wants an explanation for this situation, wouldn't it be more convenient to have me around?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're getting ahead of yourself. If you think you'll be able to influence how the Curia will handle this situation–– You'll want to disabuse yourself of that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Going one step further... If you're thinking you could take the girl away if you don't like what the Lateran Curia plans to do with her..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not gonna happen. Not in your wildest dreams."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I wouldn't dare. I'm well aware of the Basilica's Gun-Knights."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I am a Lateran executor, after all. I was concerned before because I didn't know what was happening with Cecelia, or exactly who was after her..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now that I understand, I will comply with your arrangements."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Um... Your name is Cecelia? Can you walk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ezell..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Cecelia, I can carry you, if you're too tired."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll carry her. You're too slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(*whispers*) Mister Ezell, I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry. Everything will be okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Executor Ezell Pastore went to 7-265 Via Thervatius in Pagus Stevonus this morning to verify an identity, record a will, and retrieve a patron firearm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Around noon, Ezell appeared in Stevonus Central Hospital, taking in an eight-year-old Sankta girl and departing in an unusual manner."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The resident of 7-265 Via Thervatius, Pagus Stevonus, Feoria La Porta, died of illness this morning and the body was moved to the Ecclesia Requietum."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Only one individual is registered to 7-265 Via Thervatius, and the census pagus also records only one individual residing there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "An investigation of twenty years of maintenance records at 7-265 Via Thervatius revealed that a basement had been added seven years ago, with contractor documents indicating that the space would be for storage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is a file photo of Feoria La Porta and surveillance footage of the girl that Ezell took to the hospital."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You must've already reached a conclusion about where the girl came from."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Additionally, according to the report submitted by Ezell this morning, Feoria La Porta did not leave a will or an advance directive. The reason is quite clear: she hoped to avoid contact with the Notarial Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It is reasonable to infer that Feoria La Porta knew her time was short and sought to secure a future for her daughter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It is currently impossible to determine whether Ezell is the object of Feoria La Porta's entrustment, but based on Ezell's background, the probability is low."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Combined with the information sent back by Fiammetta, the more likely trustee should be..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Astray."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mostima, is this the reason you stayed behind in the Basilica?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just temporarily."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Pope",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't be so uptight, Vel. Cream puff?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Phew. Luckily, we went for the more conservative option."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It would've been awkward if Fiammetta walked in on me getting rid of the Notarial Hall's men."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Enough of your excuses. I'd avoid saying too much to that executor, if I were you. Cecelia's already on the Guide's side."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's just one executor, Patia. Things haven't gotten so out of hand that I need to get personally involved."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Plus, I think that executor's concerns are simple enough. He found the pity within him to cause his heart to waver, and couldn't bear to see a sweet little girl suffer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now that we understand him, it's only a matter of time until he comes over, no violence necessary."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If only Fiammetta hadn't shown up so soon..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That is to say it's your fault for not stopping Fiammetta, Patia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just kidding."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, I do take pity on that one's luck. What was a little old thing is now very complicated... That's what happens when you get ahead of yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is this, too, a trial given to us by the great and mighty Lateran?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you a believer again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A true believer wouldn't say something like that. Those sorts, who treat hardships as trials, they turn it all into... a blessing from fate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There are quite a lot of believers like that around the two of you, aren't there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'd take them over self-serving Sankta like you any day."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, what's the plan now? Once Cecelia gets to the Basilica, is she going to come out again? Do we have some way to take her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "One step at a time, Patia. If we're talking about not wanting Cecelia to step foot in the Basilica, I'm even less inclined than you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, we haven't played all our cards, have we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Go tail Fiammetta, but not too closely."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What about you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've got plenty on my plate. Just found out that someone's looking for me too. Popularity isn't all it's made out to be, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't go inviting trouble for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_372_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, looks like the next clue of the chain is clear. What do you plan to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": "char_279_excu_4",
      "operatorId": "char_279_excu",
      "portraitKey": "char_279_excu",
      "text": "I will go to him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_372_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even though I have no doubts about your, uh, strength... you're dealing with a well-connected Legatus. It'll look pretty bad if you make something out of nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": "char_279_excu_4",
      "operatorId": "char_279_excu",
      "portraitKey": "char_279_excu",
      "text": "He is involved in this incident."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_372_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We have to look into this precisely because he's involved, right? Sometimes, I envy the way you see things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_372_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But what if he doesn't know anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerToken": "char_279_excu_4",
      "operatorId": "char_279_excu",
      "portraitKey": "char_279_excu",
      "text": "I need to investigate to be clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_372_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's true. In any case, the fact that a Legatus is involved at all warrants looking into."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_372_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What I didn't expect is that Feoria, an ordinary and reclusive Sankta, would provide us with so many leads. An undocumented girl, a Legatus..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_372_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And... a Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_372_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmm, you're leaving? Not even going to say goodbye?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_372_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, alright then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_372_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now that you're gone..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_372_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't blame me, Oren. I can't stop Federico."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_372_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll put in a report for you. That's about all I can do."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's asleep."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's exhausted."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You mentioned that you made her a promise. What was it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That I'd help her find her mother."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Her mother? Wait, didn't Mostima say in the message that her mother is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, dead. Saw the body with my own eyes in the back of the Ecclesia Requietum's hearse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then, why'd you promise her that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I didn't know, at the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And then? Did you tell her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I did. But at her age, I'm not sure she understands the concepts of 'passing on' or 'death.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Must've been tough for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And... don't look so upset. I don't think the Pope... will treat the girl too harshly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Her name is Cecelia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Seniora Fiammetta..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just Fiammetta is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss Fiammetta... I was thinking, after Cecelia goes to the Basilica, will she ever come out again...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can't promise you anything. But the way I see things, all else aside, she has a halo. That makes her a Sankta."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And when dealing with a Sankta, all must obey the Commandments, be it the Lateran Curia or the Notarial Hall. At least that's what I believe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even if she's undocumented."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Uhh... is that really the main issue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who knows? Might be possible to get her registered retroactively."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, there's... something wrong with Cecelia's halo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not entirely sure how serious this whole mixed-blood Sankta issue gets... But at least the Legatus implied that Cecelia would be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A lot of foreign envoys have been gathering in Laterano lately, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "His Holiness has been preparing a major summit... I can't help but worry that Cecelia will be a target for someone trying to stir up trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sounds like you've really thought this one through."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Coming from the other angle, what would the Lateran Curia do to prevent that from happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss Fiammetta, I don't know if I should even be thinking about these things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I can't just not think."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You'll have to pardon me for being blunt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But what's the point of worrying about all this? Is there any part of it you can actually control?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you know that Cecelia is in danger, then you should also understand that for Cecelia, the Basilica is the safest place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nngh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry, I fell asleep..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did we wake you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "N-No, I just..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ezell, is that your stomach growling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Want me to buy you a donut, Cecelia?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "D-Donut? Okay! Thank you, Mister Ezell..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry, I'll go for it. I need a break, my arms are sore from carrying her around."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(*whispers*) There's no way I can handle her long-term, alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But don't do anything stupid, Ezell. I've got my eye on you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You still don't trust me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, and turn on your terminal. You're not allowed to have it off."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah, I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(*whispers*) Mister Ezell, that lady was so mean to you before... I'm scared."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry, Cecelia. She's not a bad person."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mister Ezell... can't I go see Mamma? Can't I even say goodbye to her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Um... Well, we need to take you somewhere else first, so you can be safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As for your mama... I'll tell you about her later. Let me... think about it first. Is that okay, Cecelia?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Um..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you hear that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hear what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Someone is singing..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's see... Oh, you're right! It seems to be coming from that cotton candy cart... But I'm surprised you could hear it with all the noise on the street. You have really good hearing, Cecelia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's because I recognize that song!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mamma taught it to me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Um... I can't go off on my own, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's okay. We can't go over there, but I can get the cotton candy cart to come over here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Excuse me––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Serene Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_362_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is someone calling us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Merry Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_364_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hum hum hum~♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Serene Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_362_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You really like that song, don't you...? Hey, there really is someone hailing us. Let's head over there. If we can't get any info, let's at least make some money."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Merry Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_364_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All~ righty~♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hello..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Merry Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_364_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh hello, little girl, would you like some cotton candy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We'll get two, or actually, three sticks. This flavor here, this one here, and then the swirl. Is that alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Merry Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_364_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Serene Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_362_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Three sticks, coming right up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Um, excuse me... What's the name of that song you were singing earlier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mamma taught me the same song, but never told me what it's called..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Merry Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_364_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh? Your mama... taught you this song?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Um, excuse me, the cotton candy! The cotton candy is coming out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Merry Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_364_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ahh, I'm so very sorry, just give me a moment––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hold on, the compartment's about to overflow! Let me help you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Merry Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_364_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry, sorry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Serene Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_362_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(*whispers*) Your hat!!! Your hat's caught!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Merry Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_363_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*rip*––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Serene Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_362_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W-Wait, don't get the wrong idea, she's a Caprinae..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your horns look just like Papà's..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you also a Sarkaz?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "––––––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Serene Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_362_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(*whispers*) Put it back on!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Merry Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_363_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I, no, I'm... Little missy, you, you've got it all wrong..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A Sarkaz infiltrating Laterano... Are you also after Cecelia?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What happened, Ezell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss Fiammetta, this particular individual... is a Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But there's another sentence that I dare not say."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Serene Peddler",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_362_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tch... Guess we have no choice, now that it's come to this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've got guts, I'll give you that..."
